def dd(a,x): return sum((a[i]-x[i])**2 for i in range(3))
GREY=(128,128,128); LSG=(119,136,153); DG=(169,169,169); RB=(188,143,143)
cons=[]
def add(name, x, winner_is_gray, competitor, eps=0):
    # if winner_is_gray: d_gray <= d_comp ; else d_gray > d_comp
    cons.append((name, tuple(x), winner_is_gray, tuple(competitor), eps))
# ramp
for v in range(129,145): add("ramp%d"%v,(v,v,v),True,GREY)
add("ramp128",(128,128,128),False,GREY)
for v in range(129,145): add("rampL%d"%v,(v,v,v),True,LSG)
add("ramp145",(145,145,145),False,LSG)
# (128,128,v)
for v in range(129,144): add("z%d"%v,(128,128,v),True,LSG)
add("z144",(128,128,144),False,LSG)
# (128,v,v)
for v in range(129,140): add("y%d"%v,(128,v,v),True,LSG)
add("y140",(128,140,140),False,LSG)
# (v,128,v)
for v in range(129,153): add("x%d"%v,(v,128,v),True,LSG)
add("x153",(153,128,153),False,LSG)
# (v,v,128)
for v in range(129,155): add("w%d"%v,(v,v,128),True,RB)
add("w155",(155,155,128),False,RB)
# (128,v,128),(v,128,128) gray wins up to 161
for v in range(129,162):
    add("p%d"%v,(128,v,128),True,DG)
    add("q%d"%v,(v,128,128),True,DG)
sols=[]
for r in range(0,256):
  for g in range(0,256):
    for b in range(0,256):
      a=(r,g,b); ok=True
      for nm,x,isg,comp,eps in cons:
          d1=dd(a,x); d2=dd(comp,x)
          if isg:
              if d1>d2+eps: ok=False;break
          else:
              if d1<=d2-eps: ok=False;break
      if ok: sols.append(a)
print(len(sols))
for s in sols[:50]: print(s)
